      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "记忆：分量循环『十字相乘相减』；y 分量因行列式展开带 − 号，最容易抄错",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 356388140,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
